Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.57,0:20:47.55,screen_text,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,0)\blur2\an7\bord0\p1\fscy220\alpha&H10&\c&H574F39&\b0\pos(205.331,276.666)}m 0 0 l 203 0 240 16 0 15
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:45.99,Default,Vantner,0,0,0,,My axe I asked you to repair!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.99,0:20:47.55,Default,Vantner,0,0,0,,It has a new skill!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.55,0:20:52.72,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,If I Appraise equipment,\NI can find its hidden skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:54.97,Default,Vantner,0,0,0,,I've never heard of that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.97,0:20:57.11,Default,Toban,0,0,0,,Then Appraise mine, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:21:00.41,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,I'll give you a deal \Nand do it for thirty gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.41,0:21:02.61,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Sometimes, they don't have hidden skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.61,0:21:05.28,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,but if it does, you owe \Nme another 300 gol—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:05.28,top,Faker,0,0,0,,My weapon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:06.89,Default,Laella,0,0,0,,My armor, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.89,0:21:08.14,Default,Zednos,0,0,0,,Mine, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:10.62,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Shut up! Decide on an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:11.95,Default,Zednos,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.95,0:21:12.81,Default,Faker,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.81,0:21:14.21,Default,Laella,0,0,0,,Draw lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.67,0:21:16.37,Default,Ventner,0,0,0,,Do ghost leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.91,0:21:18.80,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:20.68,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,They sure are loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.68,0:21:22.71,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,It's like they're all friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.77,0:21:26.60,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,We've been struggling lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.01,0:21:31.01,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,But now everyone is pumped. \NIt's all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.01,0:21:32.27,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Jishuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.27,0:21:35.06,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,The power to create valuable items...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:37.45,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,And swordsmanship strong \Nenough to defeat Malaxus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:39.48,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,Grid...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:42.74,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,You must have a legendary job, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.59,0:21:44.91,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,She figured it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:47.74,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to keep it \Na secret for long, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:50.99,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,Why does she look so sexy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:53.95,Default,Grid,0,0,0,,Well... you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.45,0:21:58.12,Default,Jishuka,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you joined us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.81,0:22:02.89,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,S-Some bad stuff happened \Nin real life, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.55,0:22:06.01,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,G-Get a hold of yourself, Takumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.01,0:22:08.43,italics,Grid,0,0,0,,You won't let women deceive you anymore!

